---
import Layout from '../layouts/BlogPost.astro';
---

<Layout
	title="About"
	description="Hi, I'm Heran. I review AI tools and share what actually works."
	pubDate={new Date('May 23 2026')}
>
	<p>
		Hey, I'm Heran — a builder and AI tools enthusiast. I spend my days testing desktop AI agents, workflow automation tools, and productivity software so you don't have to wade through marketing hype.
	</p>

	<p>
		Every review on this site comes from hands-on testing. I look at real performance data, actual user workflows, and honest trade-offs. No sponsored rankings, no affiliate-driven recommendations.
	</p>

	<p>
		If you're looking for straightforward takes on AI tools that respect your time, you're in the right place.
	</p>

	<p>
		Got a tool you want me to review? Reach out at heran11011@gmail.com.
	</p>
</Layout>
